ulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "b39b33a3-0868-5afa-a7f0-d6de0292d950" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int 4 \\cdot 5^{3 - x^{2}} x\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nYou may use $\\int 5^{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\frac{5^{u}}{\\ln{\\left(5 \\right)}}+C$.\n\n{{answer}} $+C$" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=3 - x^{2}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(- 2 x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int 4 \\cdot 5^{3 - x^{2}} x\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=-2\\left(\\int 5^{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the supplied primitive:\n\n$$\n-2\\left(\\int 5^{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=-2\\left(\\frac{5^{u}}{\\ln{\\left(5 \\right)}}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n-2\\left(\\frac{5^{3 - x^{2}}}{\\ln{\\left(5 \\right)}}\\right)+C.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186679391 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "9475f9e5-227c-5840-b910-548f1ff669d7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "- \\frac{1}{3}\\left(\\frac{2^{2 - x^{3}}}{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}}\\right)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186679377}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "9475f9e5-227c-5840-b910-548f1ff669d7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "- \\frac{1}{3}\\left(\\frac{2^{2 - x^{3}}}{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}}\\right)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186679377} :answer-field/id #uuid "bc4c58f1-54f1-5fc4-afa2-c408278c98da" :answer-field/key "answer" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186679392}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "b6f971f5-bfd8-5a38-88b4-48e833781b26" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int 2^{2 - x^{3}} x^{2}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nYou may use $\\int 2^{u}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\frac{2^{u}}{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}}+C$.\n\n{{answer}} $+C$" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=2 - x^{3}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(- 3 x^{2})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&